Comments to the author

The manuscript begins: "We outline the proof of the geometric
Langlands conjecture." It takes 13 steps and publishes once.

The result was not available to me. I have read the proof closely.

The manuscript is a response to my report on [langlands.sheaf].
The authors thank me. I have read it again, as revised. Of the two
comments they quote, one still stands.

1. Line 3 cites [GLC I]. There is no [GLC I].

2. Line 4 cites [GLC II]. There is no [GLC II].

3. Line 5 cites [GLC III]. There is no [GLC III].

4. Line 6 cites [GLC IV]. There is no [GLC IV].

5. Line 7 cites [GLC V]. There is no [GLC V].

6. Lines 17, 18 and 19 are well known. Please give references.

7. Lines 14 and 15 say "clearly". Please show the steps. The
   authors respectfully disagree. I maintain it.

Recommendation: major revision.

